{"product_id":"the-gem-juul-usb-charger","title":"The GEM - JUUL USB Charger","description":"\u003ch3\u003eAbout the GEM Magnetic USB JUUL Charger\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIrritated with Juul Charger? Now buy The Gem Juul charger with usb cable\/ wire. If you’ve misplaced or broken the USB charging cord that your JUUL device came with, or you just want to have an extra one available to keep in your office, car, home, or anywhere else, the GEM Magnetic USB JUUL Charger is a great choice. The cord is 2.6 feet long, which gives you plenty of flexibility. It works with JUUL devices that come with the \u003ca title=\"Juul Starter Kit\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/juul-starter-kit\"\u003eJuul Starter Kit\u003c\/a\u003e, and the \u003ca title=\"Juul basic kit\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/juul-basic-kit\"\u003eJuul Basic Kit\u003c\/a\u003e. What’s more is that this magnetic USB charger works with any USB port.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe GEM Magnetic USB JUUL Charger is a must-have accessory for any JUUL user.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003e2.6 Feet Long Cable Length\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cem\u003eMagnetic USB charging cable for the JUUL Pods System.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"The GEM","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531771486263,"sku":"69d25d51ae67a","price":960.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/the-gem-magnetic-juul-usb-charger-1pc.jpg?v=1741710088","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/the-gem-juul-usb-charger","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




